<title>SPAIN: Spain's Dragados Q1 gp pre-tax profit up 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Dragados Q1 gp pre-tax profit up 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish building company Dragados y Construcciones posted a 2.5 percent rise in first quarter 1997 group pre-tax profit to 2.10 billion pesetas, a statement said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The statement added that turnover was up 3.8 percent to 98.29 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>At the end of March the group had orders pending totalling 830 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>No-one at Dragados was immediately available to provide further details.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
